	(text "\nEEPROM: STM24256-DFMN6TP (256Kb, I²C, 2-wire), \n\npin-compatible with 24LC256-family devices. \n\nStandard 4.7kΩ SDA/SCL pull-ups, 100nF decoupling. \n\nWP tied low for unrestricted write access. \n\nWorks with any I²C-capable MCU (RP2040, ESP32, AVR, etc.) \n\nat 3.3V or 5V logic per EEPROM datasheet rating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
